    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20340" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοο-σσόος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>driving oxen wild</i>, of the gadfly, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				11.191
			</span></i>: 
				contr.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουσσόον ὅν τε μύωπα . . καλέουσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					46
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Cerc.
				8.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ox-driving</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέντρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					5.64
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				11.149
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοηλάτης</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, epith. of Hermes, ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.31
			</span></i>.</div>
